Vendored source (copied into this repository)
---------------------------------------------

The UI primitives under src/shared/components/ui/ and the helpers in
src/shared/lib/utils.ts and src/shared/hooks/use-mobile.ts were generated with
the shadcn CLI from the shadcn/ui registry and then adapted to this project's
import aliases and formatting.

  shadcn/ui — MIT License — https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui

The theme token contract in src/config/style/theme.css follows the shadcn/ui
CSS variable convention; the values are this project's own.

